<section class="ex-note" id="classification">
<h2>1. Classification &amp; Overview（脂肪層炎的分類與總覽）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Panniculitis（皮下脂肪發炎）的臨床與病理表現常有重疊，常造成診斷困難；有用的病理分類是 <strong>septal</strong> 與 <strong>lobular</strong>，再依 vasculitis 的有無與浸潤細胞組成細分（Table 73-1、73-2）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1251</span></li>
<li>脂肪組織（AT）的 adipocyte 具有 innate immune 功能：可經 pattern recognition receptors（PRRs）與 Toll-like receptors（TLRs）辨識病原。<span class="ex-ref">p.1251</span></li>
<li>診斷取樣：Fitzpatrick 寫 examination of AT requires <strong>large excisional biopsies</strong>，因浸潤可能被漏掉，可能需要多於 1 次 biopsy。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span> McKee 寫懷疑 panniculitis 時 deep surgical incisional biopsy 是必要的，punch biopsy 在診斷上沒有角色。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.351</span></li>
<li>McKee 另指出 lobule 與 septa 的組織學分法在某種程度上是人為的，因為多數疾病兩者都侵犯；lipophagic fat necrosis 是最常遇到的 fat necrosis 亞型，常是許多 panniculitis 的次要特徵。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.351</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Septal vs Lobular（Table 73-2）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Septal panniculitis</th><th scope="col">Lobular panniculitis</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Origin of inflammation</td><td>Interlobular septa</td><td>Primarily the lobule or blood vessel</td></tr>
<tr><td>Appearance of lobule</td><td>Lobule appears intact, individual adipocytes well defined</td><td>Lobule is necrotic, lipophages common; free liquid may accumulate in pools of varying shapes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Necrosis</td><td>Absent</td><td>Common</td></tr>
<tr><td>Inflammatory cell</td><td>Neutrophils（acute）；mononuclear cells, multinucleated giant cells（chronic）</td><td>Lymphoid infiltrates；plasma cells are common</td></tr>
<tr><td>Vasculitis</td><td>Absent</td><td>May be present</td></tr>
<tr><td>Characteristic finding</td><td>Miescher granuloma</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>Associated conditions</td><td>Erythema nodosum</td><td>Erythema induratum、lupus panniculitis、pancreatic panniculitis、lipodermatosclerosis、α1-antitrypsin deficiency</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-2，p.1255。</p>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Miescher granuloma 在 Table 73-2 列為 septal panniculitis 的 characteristic finding（p.1255）；內文寫它 is characteristic, but not sensitive or specific（p.1256），並且 has been described in other types of panniculitis（p.1257）。</aside>
<h3>各型 panniculitis 摘要（Table 73-1）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Panniculitis</th><th scope="col">Age / group（年齡或族群）</th><th scope="col">Sites（好發部位）</th><th scope="col">Histopathology</th><th scope="col">Treatment（表列）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Erythema nodosum</td><td>Young women, 2nd to 4th decades</td><td>Anterior lower extremities</td><td>Septal；no vasculitis；neutrophils（early）、Miescher granulomas（late）</td><td>Bed rest、aspirin、NSAIDs；SSKI；colchicine；corticosteroids（rarely indicated）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema induratum</td><td>Young/middle-aged women</td><td>Calves、anterolateral leg</td><td>Lobular, often with vasculitis（<strong class="ex-n">90%</strong>）；early central necrosis of adipocytes；neutrophilic infiltrate；older lesions 有 epithelioid histiocytes 與 multinucleated giant cells</td><td>MTB 檢測陽性：full course of multidrug therapy；treat underlying cause；SSKI、NSAIDs、colchicine、antimalarials、corticosteroids、gold；bed rest；pentoxifylline、compression</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lipodermatosclerosis</td><td>Overweight women older than 40 years</td><td>Most commonly anteromedial calf area</td><td>Stasis changes；lobular；no vasculitis；ischemic necrosis at center；thickened fibrotic septa、atrophy of subcutaneous fat；membranocystic changes</td><td>Compression therapy（<strong class="ex-n">30-40 mm Hg</strong>）為 major recommended treatment；stanozolol；pentoxifylline 等；weight loss</td></tr>
<tr><td>Infectious panniculitis</td><td>—</td><td>Most commonly on legs and feet；upper extremities, trunk, face may be involved</td><td>Mostly lobular with a mixed pattern；neutrophilic infiltrate</td><td>Depends on the known organisms</td></tr>
<tr><td>α1-Antitrypsin panniculitis</td><td>Most common in 30-60 years of age groups</td><td>Lower trunk, also buttocks, proximal extremities</td><td>Early necrosis of SQ fat；splaying of neutrophils between collagen bundles is characteristic；liquefactive necrosis</td><td>Mild-moderate：dapsone、doxycycline；severe：protein replacement therapy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pancreatic panniculitis</td><td>Occurs in 2%-3% of patients with pancreatic disorders（表列）</td><td>Lower extremities, especially periarticular areas（knee, ankle）</td><td>Lobular；no vasculitis；intense necrosis at center of lobule；ghost adipocytes；saponification and calcification</td><td>Octreotide；plasmapheresis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lupus panniculitis</td><td>Females more than males（4:1）；30-60 years old, also in childhood</td><td>Upper arms（lateral）、shoulders、face、scalp、hips、buttocks、breasts；rare on lower extremities</td><td>Mostly lobular，with lymphoid follicles、variable hyaline fat necrosis、sclerotic collagen bundles、lymphocytic and plasma cell infiltrate</td><td>Hydroxychloroquine is first-line；quinacrine</td></tr>
<tr><td>Panniculitis with dermatomyositis</td><td>Very rare</td><td>Arms, buttocks, thighs, abdomen</td><td>Mixed septal and lobular；lymphocytic and plasma cell infiltrate；hyaline sclerosis of septal collagen；calcification、membranocystic changes in late stages</td><td>Corticosteroids alone, or corticosteroids with methotrexate</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cytophagic histiocytic panniculitis</td><td>Rare；adults, adolescents, children</td><td>Extremities, trunk</td><td>Lobular；no vasculitis；bean bag cells；necrosis</td><td>Corticosteroids；cyclosporine；multidisciplinary care in a hospital setting</td></tr>
<tr><td>Subcutaneous fat necrosis of the newborn</td><td>Rare, first few weeks of life</td><td>Buttocks, back, shoulders, cheeks, thighs；anterior trunk spared</td><td>Lobular；no vasculitis；needle-shaped clefts in radial array</td><td>Spontaneous resolution；monitor serum calcium</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cold panniculitis（Haxthausen disease）</td><td>Scrotal cold panniculitis in 9–14-year-old males</td><td>Face, thighs, scrotal fat of prepubertal boys</td><td>Lobular；no vasculitis；perivascular lymphohistiocytic infiltrate</td><td>Spontaneous resolution</td></tr>
<tr><td>Factitial panniculitis</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Lobular；no vasculitis；suppurative granuloma involving fat lobule；refractile foreign material</td><td>Psychiatric treatment；intralesional steroids, surgical excision</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-1，p.1252–1254（以原頁圖片核對各欄）。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="en">
<h2>2. Erythema Nodosum, EN（結節性紅斑）</h2>
<h3>Epidemiology（流行病學）</h3>
<ul>
<li>EN 是 prototypic septal panniculitis，是常見的 panniculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>各年齡都可發生，多數為 <strong>young women in the second to fourth decades</strong>；較大型研究 &gt;<strong class="ex-n">80%</strong> 為女性（female-to-male ratio <strong class="ex-n">5:1</strong>）；兒童病例沒有性別差異。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>McKee：女性比例在某些系列可高達 <strong class="ex-n">9 : 1</strong>；兒童只是罕見受侵犯。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.351</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="111-08">tender、erythematous、warm 的 nodules 與 plaques，最常在 anterior lower legs 與 ankles</mark>；前臂、上腿、軀幹甚至臉也可受侵犯，非典型部位在兒童較常見。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>結節可融合、呈紫色似瘀青，有出血時稱 <strong>erythema contusiformis</strong>；<mark data-q="111-08">Ulceration and scarring are not seen</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>全身症狀：fever、malaise、fatigue、arthralgia、arthritis、headache；較少見有 abdominal pain、vomiting、diarrhea、cough。Upper respiratory tract infection 在 <strong class="ex-n">20% to 30%</strong> 的病例先於 EN 發生。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>檢驗常提示病因：streptococcal infection 時 throat culture 陽性與 leukocytosis；endemic area 與高風險族群中 PPD 陽性提示結核；chest radiograph 異常可見於 sarcoidosis 或肺部感染。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：病程 <strong class="ex-n">3 to 6 weeks</strong>，新病灶可持續出現至 <strong class="ex-n">6 weeks</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1255</span></li>
<li>McKee：病灶 1–15 cm，常為多發、雙側、對稱；紅色逐漸變為 bluish 或 livid，再變 yellow，類似瘀青；病程 3–6 weeks。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.351</span></li>
<li>McKee 的變異型：<strong>erythema nodosum migrans</strong>（病灶中央消退、周邊長新結節，通常 asymmetrical、unilateral、只在腿部，發病年齡較古典型大，mean age 50 years）；<strong>chronic erythema nodosum</strong>（結節持續數月到數年）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.351–352</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Etiology &amp; Pathogenesis（病因與機轉）</h3>
<ul>
<li>EN 與許多病因相關；large reviews 中 idiopathic 佔 <strong class="ex-n">37% to 60%</strong>（McKee 寫 <strong class="ex-n">20–30%</strong> 無明顯原因）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span><span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.354</span></li>
<li>Infection：兒童 EN 最常見的病因是 streptococcal respiratory tract infections；<mark data-q="111-08">EN secondary to tuberculosis 在 endemic areas 較常見，但在美國與歐洲罕見</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="115-18">Infections（commonly streptococcal）、medications、malignancies（leukemias, lymphomas）都是 EN 的 associated factors</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1252</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
<li>Drugs：常見有 antibiotics、<mark data-q="112-44">oral contraceptives and other hormonal therapies</mark>、NSAIDs；近期病例還有 omeprazole、leukotriene inhibitors、vemurafenib。<mark data-q="112-44">自從 low-dose estrogen 問世，oral contraceptive 引起的 EN 比例下降</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
<li>Malignancy：most often leukemias 或 lymphomas。Sarcoidosis 與 inflammatory bowel disease 也是已知病因；<mark data-q="109-47">sarcoidosis-induced EN 的比例因地區與族群而異，可佔 EN 病例的 up to one-third</mark>；temporal arteritis 也曾被報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
<li>Table 73-3 另列有 Behçet disease、ulcerative colitis、Crohn disease、reactive arthritis、Sweet syndrome、pregnancy、Hodgkin disease、non-Hodgkin lymphoma、leukemia、renal carcinoma 等。<span class="ex-ref">p.1257</span></li>
<li>McKee：early twentieth century 時成人 EN 的 tuberculosis 可高達 <strong class="ex-n">90%</strong>，現在 &lt;<strong class="ex-n">1%</strong>；現今較常見的關聯包括 streptococcal infections、sarcoidosis、ulcerative colitis 與 Crohn disease、Sweet syndrome、Behçet disease、pregnancy、estrogens 與 oral contraceptive、cat scratch disease、藥物。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.352</span></li>
<li>Pathogenesis：被視為對上述病因的 <strong>hypersensitivity reaction</strong>；其他理論包括 immune complex deposition 與 neutrophil 參與；整體機轉 not understood。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span> McKee：immune complex-mediated vasculitis 不被認為可能，較可能是 non-specific hypersensitivity reaction（delayed hypersensitivity 加上 type 3 成分）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.352</span></li>
<li>EN 與較輕且較短病程的 sarcoidosis 相關，特別是帶有 HLA-DRB1*03 的病人。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Sarcoidosis 可引起 EN（p.1256）；Fitzpatrick ch35 寫 erythema nodosum is the main nonspecific cutaneous manifestation of sarcoidosis（<span class="ex-ref">p.575（ch35）</span>）。Table 73-4 把 sarcoidosis 列為 EN 的鑑別診斷，其 biopsy 特徵為 sarcoidal granulomas in dermis or subcutis（p.1258）。</aside>
<h3>Histopathology（病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>EN 通常是 <strong>septal pattern</strong>，發炎主要限於 septa。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
<li>Early EN：septae 水腫，有 neutrophils 與 extravasated red blood cells。隨病程 septae 變寬並纖維化，出現含 lymphocytes、histiocytes、neutrophils 與少數 eosinophils 的混合浸潤；late lesions 的 septae 寬且纖維化，常有 granulomas，fat lobules 可被侵蝕。上方 dermis 常有淺層與深層的 perivascular infiltrate。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256</span></li>
<li><strong>Miescher granuloma</strong>：histiocytes 圍繞中央 stellate cleft；characteristic but not sensitive or specific，被視為 early EN 的特徵但並非普遍存在，也見於其他 panniculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1256–1257</span></li>
<li>Late EN 可有 lipomembranous change；<strong>vasculitis</strong> 依定義是 characteristically absent，但有人強調 early EN 可有 thrombophlebitis，medium-vessel arteritis 也可能（rarely）出現。<span class="ex-ref">p.1257</span></li>
<li>McKee：早期 septal 浸潤為 neutrophils，之後被 lymphocytes 與 histiocytes 取代；septal 浸潤常外溢到 lobule 周邊形成 lacy appearance；hemorrhage 幾乎必有；<strong>Coagulation and caseation-like necrosis are never seen</strong>；Miescher radial granuloma 也曾見於 Sweet syndrome、nodular vasculitis 與 necrobiosis lipoidica；frank vasculitis 只在極少數見到。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.354</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-4）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristic features</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Erythema induratum / nodular vasculitis</td><td>Most common on posterior calves with ulceration</td></tr>
<tr><td>Simple bruising</td><td>History of trauma or anticoagulation；缺乏 warmth 等發炎特徵；tender only to palpation，自行痊癒</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutaneous polyarteritis nodosa</td><td>Nodules with livedo reticularis；histology 見 arterial inflammation，可伴 neuropathy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sarcoidosis</td><td>Sarcoidal granulomas in dermis or subcutis；often with systemic sarcoidosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cellulitis</td><td>Larger plaques，erythematous 但缺乏 violaceous bruising；more tender and warm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lipodermatosclerosis</td><td>Firm plaques nearly circumferential around lower leg</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pancreatic panniculitis</td><td>Occurs anywhere on the legs；ulceration and drainage；serum lipase and amylase often elevated</td></tr>
<tr><td>Behçet syndrome occurring in the fat</td><td>Vasculitis in fat tissue（lymphocytic or neutrophilic）；small arterial involvement；lobular 或 mixed lobular and septal pattern</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sweet syndrome</td><td>Nodules 可在臉、頸、上軀幹與四肢，可有 vesicles、pustules、bullae；histology 見 intense dermal edema 與 diffuse deep neutrophilic infiltrate with karyorrhexis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Subcutaneous tuberculosis / atypical mycobacterial infection</td><td>Endemic areas；microbiology 特徵與 histopathology 見 acid-fast bacilli</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-4，p.1258。</p>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>EN 是 benign、self-limiting 的疾病，幾週內緩解；藥物誘發者停藥後可改善，再用藥時會復發。New lesions 在 6 週後少見；<strong class="ex-n">6% to 34%</strong> 的病例會 relapse；找不到病因者較容易復發。Sarcoidosis 所致的 EN 預後較佳；recurrence 在 sarcoidosis、hormonal therapy 與 pregnancy、streptococcal infection 時較常見；Crohn disease 合併 EN 的病人較可能有 colonic involvement。<span class="ex-ref">p.1258</span></li>
<li>治療重點：找出並處理病因（排除或治療 infection、停用可疑藥物）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1258</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-08">Supportive care 是 mainstay：bed rest（嚴重時）、下肢抬高、NSAIDs</mark>；SSKI 劑量 <strong class="ex-n">2-10 drops</strong>、每日 <strong class="ex-n">3</strong> 次（1 drop = 0.03 mL = 30 mg），使用前須做 thyroid disorder 與 pregnancy 篩檢，風險有 hypothyroidism、goiter、heart and lung toxicity。<span class="ex-ref">p.1258–1259</span></li>
<li>Colchicine 對 Behçet-related EN 有效；etanercept 與 infliximab 是 inflammatory bowel disease-associated EN 的選項；oxyphenbutazone 與 hydroxychloroquine 的 randomized controlled trials 有限。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-08">Corticosteroids are not first-line therapy</mark>，因為 idiopathic EN 有感染性病因的風險。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>EN 的病灶 ulceration and scarring are not seen（p.1255）；Table 73-4 寫 erythema induratum/nodular vasculitis 最常在 posterior calves 並有 ulceration（p.1258）。Fitzpatrick 寫 MTB can cause both EN and EI（p.1261）。EN 的 corticosteroids 不是 first-line（p.1259）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="ei-nv">
<h2>3. Erythema Induratum &amp; Nodular Vasculitis, EI/NV（硬結性紅斑與結節性血管炎）</h2>
<h3>Definition &amp; Epidemiology（定義與流行病學）</h3>
<ul>
<li>EI 最初與 <em>Mycobacterium tuberculosis</em>（MTB）相關，典型表現為小腿潰瘍性結節；沒有 MTB 關聯的類似疾病稱 NV。兩者臨床上太相似而無法分開，所以兩個名詞 most often used interchangeably。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li>EI/NV 是 panniculitis with vasculitis 中最常見的診斷。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li>多見於 young to middle-aged women，female dominance 可達 <strong class="ex-n">9:1</strong>；年齡 8 個月至 66 歲，mean age <strong class="ex-n">36.6</strong> years。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-08">EI 病灶冬季較常發生，與 obesity 和 venous insufficiency 相關</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li>McKee：多見於年輕或中年女性，常有 erythrocyanotic circulation，overweight with fat calves 者最常受侵犯；冬季發生率增加；潰瘍常見，癒合後常有疤痕與色素沉著。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.372</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li>小腿復發性 erythematous 到 violaceous 的 nodules 與 deep plaques，可能 tender，但 often not painful。<mark data-q="111-08">Ulceration often leads to scarring</mark>；表面可有潰瘍結痂與 collarette of scale。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-08">Posterior calf 是最常見位置</mark>；也可見於腳的 anterolateral 區、大腿，罕見於手臂與臉。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li>MTB-associated EI 的一致性全身發現是 tuberculoid skin test 陽性（包括 Mantoux test 或 tuberculin-purified protein derivative）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Etiology &amp; Pathogenesis（病因與機轉）</h3>
<ul>
<li>PCR 使許多培養陰性的病例被證實含有 MTB DNA。<span class="ex-ref">p.1259</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-08,115-18">感染性病因：MTB、hepatitis B 與 hepatitis C</mark>（Table 73-1）；NV 也曾與 ulcerative colitis、leukemia、rheumatoid arthritis、hypothyroidism、Nocardia infection、<em>Chlamydophila pneumoniae</em> 相關，Crohn disease 是罕見病因；藥物有 propylthiouracil 與 etanercept；BCG 疫苗接種後 2 至 3 個月也有 EI 的報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.1252</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1260</span></li>
<li>In vitro：MTB 可進入 adipocytes，以其 lipases 利用宿主脂質，在 nonreplicating state 存活，此狀態對 isoniazid 不敏感；rifampin 與 ethambutol 可使 adipocytes 內 MTB 負荷降低 <strong class="ex-n">80% to 90%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1260</span></li>
<li>EI 被視為 hypersensitivity disorder（immune complex 或 cell-mediated hypersensitivity），表現為 tuberculin skin test 與 interferon-γ release assay 呈高度陽性；許多 EI 病人可找到 extracutaneous MTB（lung、lymph nodes、kidney、bowel、adrenal glands 等）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1260</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Histopathology（病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>共同點是 <strong>mostly lobular 或 mixed septal and lobular panniculitis</strong>；<span class="ex-ref">p.1260</span> 在 101 例 EI 的回顧中，<strong class="ex-n">90%</strong> 有 vasculitis（lobular venules、septal veins、septal arteries）；嚴重 immunocompromised 的病人可缺乏 vasculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1261</span></li>
<li>早期：fat lobules 內有以 neutrophils 為主的 inflammatory cell aggregates，無 leukocytoclasia；adipocyte necrosis 產生 foamy histiocytes。<span class="ex-ref">p.1260–1261</span></li>
<li>已成形的病灶：epithelioid histiocytes、multinucleated giant cells 與 lymphocytes 呈肉芽腫樣外觀；明顯血管破壞時伴廣泛 <strong>caseous necrosis</strong>，可涉及上方 dermis 造成潰瘍；eosinophils 可存在，不違背診斷。<span class="ex-ref">p.1261</span></li>
<li>McKee：vasculitis 傳統上被視為診斷必要條件，但 101 個切片的研究中 <strong class="ex-n">9.9%</strong> 找不到 vasculitis；最常受侵犯的是 small lobular veins；fat necrosis 一定存在，從 lipophagic 到 coagulative，較少為 caseation-like；Asteroid inclusions 與 Schaumann bodies 不是 erythema induratum 的特徵。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.373–374</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-5）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristic features</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Erythema nodosum</td><td>Most common on anterior legs with no ulceration and no scarring</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutaneous polyarteritis nodosa</td><td>Livedo reticularis 與 arterial inflammation，可伴 neuropathy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sarcoidosis</td><td>Sarcoidal granulomas in dermis or subcutis；often with systemic sarcoidosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lipodermatosclerosis</td><td>Firm plaques，可近乎環繞下肢；病態肥胖者可出現在 breasts 與 abdomen</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pancreatic panniculitis</td><td>Occurs anywhere on the legs，ulceration and drainage；serum lipase and amylase often elevated</td></tr>
<tr><td>Behçet syndrome occurring in the fat</td><td>Lymphocytic or neutrophilic vasculitis in fat tissue；small arterial involvement</td></tr>
<tr><td>Subcutaneous Sweet syndrome</td><td>Nodules 可在臉、頸、上軀幹、四肢；histology 見 intense dermal edema 與 diffuse deep neutrophilic infiltrate with karyorrhexis</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-5，p.1261。</p>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>EI/NV 可有 protracted course，數月至數年反覆發作；EI 的病程常比 EN 更慢性，潰瘍與疤痕使外觀與功能後果比 EN 更差。<span class="ex-ref">p.1261</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="111-08">MTB culture 陽性、tuberculoid skin test 陽性或 interferon-γ release assay 陽性（例如 QuantiFERON-TB Gold in-tube assay）時，須給 multiple agent anti-TB therapy</mark>；IGRA 陰性但在 high-risk TB area 仍高度懷疑時，建議 lesional PCR。<span class="ex-ref">p.1261</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="115-18">Hepatitis B 或 hepatitis C 病人須給適當 antiviral intervention</mark>；其他感染要找出並治療，可能致病的藥物須停用。<span class="ex-ref">p.1261</span></li>
<li>非 MTB 相關 NV 使用過的消炎治療：SSKI、NSAIDs、corticosteroids、gold，加上 bed rest 與下肢抬高、compression 與 pentoxifylline，甚至 mycophenolate mofetil；若使用 immunosuppressive agents，建議監測是否有感染性病因。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick 寫 MTB can cause both EN and EI（p.1261）；EI 的感染性病因包括 MTB、hepatitis B、hepatitis C（p.1252）；IGRA 陰性但臨床高度懷疑時建議 lesional PCR（p.1261）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="lds">
<h2>4. Lipodermatosclerosis, LDS（脂肪皮膚硬化症）</h2>
<h3>Epidemiology（流行病學）</h3>
<ul>
<li>同義詞：sclerosing panniculitis、hypodermitis sclerodermiformis、chronic panniculitis with lipomembranous changes、sclerotic atrophic cellulitis、venous stasis panniculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li>LDS 是最常見的 panniculitis，臨床上看到的頻率遠高於 EN。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-12,115-18">LDS 發生於 venous insufficiency，多為 overweight women older than 40 years</mark>；年齡範圍 31 到 74 歲以上；female-to-male ratio <strong class="ex-n">4:1</strong>（某些研究高達 <strong class="ex-n">12:1</strong>）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1252</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-12">Obesity 很常見：<strong class="ex-n">85%</strong> 的病人 body mass index &gt; <strong class="ex-n">30</strong></mark>；合併症包括 hypertension、thyroid disease、diabetes mellitus、過去下肢 cellulitis 與 deep vein thrombosis；obstructive sleep apnea 與 arthritis 也相關。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li>分 <strong>acute inflammatory stage</strong> 與 <strong>chronic fibrotic stage</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-12">Acute：very painful、poorly demarcated、cellulitis-like 的 erythematous plaques</mark>，之後演變為 violaceous、edematous 或 indurated 的 plaques 或 nodules，最常在 lower anteromedial calf。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li>單側侵犯占 <strong class="ex-n">55%</strong>、局部 plaque <strong class="ex-n">51%</strong>、<mark data-q="113-12">ulceration <strong class="ex-n">13%</strong></mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-12">疼痛很明顯，因此 acute LDS 會被誤診為 EN、cellulitis 或 thrombophlebitis</mark>；血管檢查在多數病人顯示 venous insufficiency；靜脈檢查正常者多數 BMI 偏高。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-12">Chronic：indurated 到 sclerotic、depressed、hyperpigmented 的皮膚</mark>，位於小腿下段，主要在內側或呈 stocking distribution，稱 <strong>"inverted champagne bottle"</strong> 或 "bowling pin" appearance；chronic form 不一定有明顯的 acute phase。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：indurated、firm、wood-like consistency 的 plaques；相關因素有 chronic venous insufficiency、elevated body mass index、female gender、arterial hypertension、arterial ischemia、thrombophlebitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li>McKee：多見於 middle-aged 或 elderly、overweight 女性，常有 peripheral venous disease 病史；late 病灶常為雙側對稱，呈 stocking distribution 與 inverted bottle appearance；systemic sclerosis 合併 sclerosing panniculitis 的病人常有 pulmonary hypertension。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.377</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Etiology &amp; Pathogenesis（病因與機轉）</h3>
<ul>
<li>少數藥物可誘發：gemcitabine、pemetrexed。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>可能機轉：hydrostatic pressure 升高造成血管通透性增加（tight junctions 下調）、fibrin 外滲、microthrombi、protein S 與 protein C 異常、hypoxia、endothelial 損傷；纖維化伴隨 transforming growth factor-β1 與 procollagen type 1 表現增加。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>AT 擴張（如 obesity）導致 hypoxia 與 hypoxia-inducible factor 1α 表現增加，刺激 collagen I 與 collagen III 而致纖維化。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>McKee：pathogenesis 是 centrilobular capillaries 的 venous stasis，導致 ischemia 與脂肪 infarction。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.377</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Diagnosis &amp; Histopathology（診斷與病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>診斷常靠臨床；LDS 皮膚切片的癒合過程可能困難，切片建議取自侵犯區的 proximal edge，癒合率最高；曾有 cutaneous T-cell lymphoma 與 angiosarcoma 被誤診為 LDS 的案例；MRI 可用來看病變範圍。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>Dermal stasis changes 在任一階段都有：capillaries 與 venules 增生、thick-walled small vessels、extravasated erythrocytes、hemosiderin-laden macrophages、lymphohistiocytic inflammation、fibrosis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>皮下組織：早期 septa 內有稀疏 lymphocytes，伴 central lobular ischemic fat necrosis；fat lobules 內 capillary congestion。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>Lipomembranous（membranocystic）changes：壞死脂肪中的 small pseudocystic spaces，內襯 hyaline eosinophilic membranous material，可用 periodic acid-Schiff 染色顯示；<strong>not exclusive to LDS</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>進展期：fat necrosis、septal fibrosis 與增厚增加，浸潤含 lymphocytes、histiocytes、foamy macrophages；晚期有 septal sclerosis 與 fat lobules 顯著萎縮（lipophagic fat necrosis），發炎明顯減少。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：<mark data-q="113-12">stasis changes 為背景，mostly lobular panniculitis without vasculitis</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1262</span></li>
<li>McKee：early lesions 有 centrilobular ischemia、vascular congestion/hemorrhage，可見 vascular thrombosis 但 no evidence of vasculitis；established lesions 有 microcystic change、membranous fat necrosis，septal scarring 可使皮下脂肪萎縮。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.377–378</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-6）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristics</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Erythema nodosum</td><td>Warm, tender, erythematous subcutaneous nodules on pretibial areas；a lack of preceding venous insufficiency is common</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema induratum / nodular vasculitis</td><td>Tender nodules and plaques on calf areas；vasculitis on histopathology</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cellulitis</td><td>Can occur with chronic edema, venous insufficiency；more likely unilateral and after injury or animal bite</td></tr>
<tr><td>Infection-induced panniculitis</td><td>EN-like nodules、deep inflamed nodules or abscesses；often seen in severely immunosuppressed patients</td></tr>
<tr><td>Scleroderma / morphea</td><td>Scleroderma or morphea involvement elsewhere</td></tr>
<tr><td>Deep vein thrombosis</td><td>Pain and edema of posterior calf with positive Doppler examination</td></tr>
<tr><td>Nephrogenic systemic fibrosis</td><td>Subsequent to MRI with gadolinium exposure in patients with renal dysfunction</td></tr>
<tr><td>Malignancies</td><td>Persistent, worsening disease；cutaneous T-cell lymphoma、angiosarcoma 或其他 sarcomas</td></tr>
<tr><td>Necrobiosis lipoidica</td><td>Yellow-brown, indurated plaques with an atrophic, depressed area</td></tr>
<tr><td>Eosinophilic fasciitis / Shulman syndrome</td><td>Coarse, thickened skin with peau d'orange；groove sign；peripheral blood eosinophilia and hyperglobulinemia are common</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-6，p.1264。</p>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>病程依合併症與是否遵從治療（尤其 compression）而異；acute form 可持續數月甚至一年，chronic form 可持續數年且可能難治；潰瘍與疤痕是永久的；未治療的 LDS 可造成 venolymphedema。<span class="ex-ref">p.1263</span></li>
<li>評估周邊血管：ankle brachial index（動脈）、venous Doppler（血栓）、duplex sonography（reflux）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1264</span></li>
<li><strong>Compression therapy</strong> 是 first-line；<mark data-q="113-12">arterial compromise 的病人不應做 compression therapy</mark>。較高 gradient（<strong class="ex-n">30 to 40 mm Hg</strong>）可能更有效，較低壓力（15 to 20 或 20 to 30 mm Hg）有助依從性並有效減少水腫；stockings 須整天穿戴，數日不穿可能使水腫與發炎復發。<span class="ex-ref">p.1264</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="110-19">Stanozolol 對 LDS 有效，可減輕 pain、erythema、induration</mark>；hepatotoxicity 表現為無症狀的 transaminases 上升，停藥後恢復；這個藥在美國無法取得；oxandrolone 與 danazol 等其他 anabolic steroids 也曾使用。<span class="ex-ref">p.1264</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-12">Pentoxifylline 已成功用於有或無 ulceration 的 LDS</mark>，是 compression 治療 venous ulcers 的有用輔助，也可能單用有效；一項研究中 hydroxychloroquine 加 pentoxifylline 在沒有 compression 下使疼痛較基線下降 <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1264</span></li>
<li>Ultrasound therapy 可減輕甚至消除 induration、tenderness、erythema；weight loss 很重要；capsaicin 可能減輕疼痛；難治病例對 intralesional autologous platelet-rich plasma（網格狀注射，每 2 週重複）有反應。<span class="ex-ref">p.1264</span></li>
<li>Table 73-1 的治療欄：compression（30-40 mm Hg）、stanozolol、pentoxifylline、horse chestnut seed extract、oxerutins、flavonoid fraction、weight loss。<span class="ex-ref">p.1252</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Pentoxifylline 在 Fitzpatrick 中是 LDS 的治療選項之一（p.1264）；stanozolol 在 Fitzpatrick 中也列為有效藥物（p.1264）。LDS 急性期的疼痛紅腫斑塊常被誤診為 EN、cellulitis 或 thrombophlebitis（p.1263）；Table 73-6 寫 cellulitis 可伴 chronic edema、venous insufficiency（p.1264）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="infectious">
<h2>5. Infection-Induced Panniculitis, IIP（感染性脂肪層炎）</h2>
<ul>
<li>IIP 是由感染原直接引起的 panniculitis，病原可為 bacteria、mycobacteria、fungi、protozoa 或 viruses。<span class="ex-ref">p.1265</span></li>
<li>Primary infection（經傷口、手術、catheter、injection、acupuncture 直接接種）通常形成單一病灶；secondary infection（sepsis 與 hematogenous spread）可為單一或多發病灶。<span class="ex-ref">p.1265</span></li>
<li>免疫抑制病人的病原體可很多，在 routine histopathology 或特殊染色可辨識；免疫正常者病原體可能很少，需 cultures、lesional PCR 或 serologic studies。<span class="ex-ref">p.1265</span></li>
<li>最常見於 immunocompromised hosts（包括 diabetes mellitus）；臨床表現從 fluctuant 或 abscess-like 病灶（有 purulence 與 ulcerations）到非特異性的 erythematous firm subcutaneous plaques、purpuric plaques 與 EN-like lesions；最常在 legs 與 feet。免疫抑制與較廣泛、abscess-type 病灶相關；免疫正常者 granulomas 常見。<span class="ex-ref">p.1265</span></li>
<li>病例舉例：immunosuppressed 病人的 fusariosis、aspergillosis、cryptococcal panniculitis（transplantation）；一例 aspergillosis 可見 pancreatic panniculitis 的 "ghost cell" 變化與 urate crystals；syphilis（plasma cells 多，<em>Treponema pallidum</em> 免疫染色陽性）；<em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> 在免疫正常宿主可模仿 subcutaneous panniculitis-like T-cell lymphoma，對 doxycycline 反應快。<span class="ex-ref">p.1265</span></li>
<li>診斷：組織染色找病原體加上 tissue culture；PCR 提高 mycobacterium 的偵測。Histopathology 為 mostly lobular panniculitis，常呈 mixed septal and lobular pattern；直接接種所致感染的 superficial dermis 發炎較多，hematogenous spread 則侵犯 deep reticular dermis 與 subcutaneous fat。<span class="ex-ref">p.1266</span></li>
<li>其他特徵：hemorrhage、vascular proliferation、basophilic necrosis、sweat gland necrosis；非潰瘍標本可見 parakeratosis、acanthosis、spongiosis。Suppurative granulomas（epithelioid histiocytes 圍繞聚集的 neutrophils）在 atypical mycobacteria 常見；cytomegalovirus-associated panniculitis 的 endothelial cells 內可見 viral inclusions。<span class="ex-ref">p.1266</span></li>
<li>治療依疑似或已知病原體與藥敏而定；MTB 與 <em>T. cruzi</em> 這類可在 AT 中維持休眠的病原體，常需要較長療程。<span class="ex-ref">p.1266</span></li>
<li>McKee：病原體須做特殊染色（bacteria 與 fungi）於所有病因不明的 panniculitis；M. chelonae 感染可見 abscess formation，病原體可出現在 neutrophils 圍繞的 microcysts 內。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.376</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-7）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristic features</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>α1-Antitrypsin panniculitis</td><td>Nodules, plaques, cellulitis-like lesions 到 fluctuant abscess-like lesions，傾向 ulcerate and drain；位於 lower trunk and proximal extremities</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pancreatic panniculitis</td><td>Occurs anywhere on the legs，ulceration and drainage；serum lipase and amylase often elevated；須用 fungal stains 排除 mucormycosis 或 aspergillosis（可造成 "ghost cell" adipocytes，尤其在 immunocompromised 病人）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Traumatic / factitial panniculitis</td><td>Variable nodules, plaques, ulceration；需要高度懷疑（high index of suspicion）；trauma can predispose to infection-induced panniculitis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema induratum / nodular vasculitis</td><td>Crops of tender nodules and plaques on posterior lower legs，often develop ulceration and drainage</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pyoderma gangrenosum</td><td>Can present at any location；highly inflammatory with characteristic rolled, elevated edges；related to trauma；not classically confined to the lower legs</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutaneous / subcutaneous lymphomas</td><td>Nodules and plaques, some with ulceration, predominantly on legs；<em>Borrelia burgdorferi</em> 引起的 panniculitis 在 immunocompetent host 可模仿</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lymphoproliferative disorders</td><td>Immunocompromised 或 posttransplantation 病人（但不限於此）；臨床與病理都須區分 benign 與 malignant</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-7，p.1266。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="aat">
<h2>6. α1-Antitrypsin Deficiency Panniculitis（α1-抗胰蛋白酶缺乏相關脂肪層炎）</h2>
<h3>Definition &amp; Epidemiology（定義與流行病學）</h3>
<ul>
<li>α1-Antitrypsin（α1AT）是肝臟製造的 glycoprotein，為 serine protease inhibitor，也是 acute phase reactant；缺乏以 <strong>codominant</strong> 方式遺傳，已知超過 <strong class="ex-n">100</strong> 種 alleles；以 gel electrophoresis 遷移分為 F（fast）、M（medium）、S（slow）、Z（very slow）與 null variants。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li><strong>Panniculitis uncommonly occurs in α1AT deficiency</strong>：已報告 fewer than <strong class="ex-n">50</strong> 例（ZZ、MZ、MS、SS 表型）；&gt;<strong class="ex-n">60%</strong> 為 ZZ，<strong class="ex-n">65%</strong> 為女性；homozygous MM 占人口 <strong class="ex-n">90% to 97%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li>各年齡都可發病，most often between ages <strong class="ex-n">30 and 60</strong> years；白人 α1AT deficiency 估計 prevalence 為 <strong class="ex-n">1 per 3000 to 5000</strong>（美國）；可在懷孕後首次出現；up to <strong class="ex-n">35%</strong> 有 preceding trauma。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="113-46">病人表現為 painful erythematous nodules and plaques</mark>，早期病灶可呈 cellulitic 或 fluctuant abscess-type 外觀。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-46">病灶可 ulcerate，流出 oily 或 serosanguinous discharge</mark>，癒合後留 atrophic scars。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="113-46">最常出現在 lower trunk（buttocks）與 proximal extremities，但 lower legs 與其他部位也可能受侵犯</mark>（Table 73-1：most common site lower trunk, also buttocks, proximal extremities）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1253</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li>α1AT panniculitis 可與 autoimmune disease、cancer 或 infection 並存，因此有 α1AT deficiency 的 panniculitis 仍須找 infection 或其他潛在疾病。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：皮下結節多位於 lower abdomen、buttocks、proximal extremities；frequent ulceration、draining lesions、手術後癒合不良與 isomorphic phenomenon。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li>系統性關聯：α1AT deficiency 與肺部及肝臟疾病相關，導致 COPD、hepatic cirrhosis 或 hepatocellular carcinoma；ZZ phenotype 風險最高；null variant 與肝病無關。<span class="ex-ref">p.1268</span></li>
<li>McKee：<mark data-q="113-46">fever 是常見的伴隨症狀（Fever is a common accompaniment）</mark>，病人常有 panacinar emphysema、chronic obstructive pulmonary disease 等肺部問題；Fitzpatrick 的臨床特徵段落（p.1267）沒有提到 fever。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358</span></li>
<li>McKee：結節常因 trauma 誘發，多在 trunk 與 proximal extremities，常有 ulceration 與 clear、serosanguinous 或 oily fluid 自發流出，deep sinuses 是重要併發症。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Pathogenesis（機轉）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Homozygous MM 的 α1AT 為正常（<strong class="ex-n">90 to 220 mg/dL</strong>）；ZZ 約為正常的 <strong class="ex-n">10% to 15%</strong>；ZZ 是最常引起 panniculitis 的 phenotype；MS heterozygous 可為 low-normal 的血清濃度；F variant 只在 FZ phenotype 與 panniculitis 相關。<span class="ex-ref">p.1268</span></li>
<li>可能機轉：缺乏對 proteases 的抑制 → 淋巴球、巨噬細胞、complement 活化，IL-1 與 IL-1β 的 autoinflammatory cascade，結締組織在發炎處被溶解破壞；adipocytes 受創釋出的 adipokines 與 cytokines 吸引發炎細胞，其 proteases 因缺乏 α1AT 而不受抑制。<span class="ex-ref">p.1268</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Histopathology（病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>At-a-glance：mostly lobular panniculitis without vasculitis；dense infiltrate of neutrophils；normal fat adjacent to necrotic adipocytes。<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></li>
<li>早期：adipocytes 水腫與退化，細胞膜破裂塌陷，perivascular mononuclear infiltrate；septa 與 lobules 有輕度 neutrophils 與 macrophages 浸潤，並有 early necrosis of SQ fat。<span class="ex-ref">p.1268</span></li>
<li><strong>Splaying of neutrophils between collagen bundles</strong>（見於整個上方 reticular dermis）被視為 early and distinctive diagnostic clue。<span class="ex-ref">p.1268</span></li>
<li>較進展的病灶：大量 neutrophils 與 histiocytes 伴 necrosis，取代 fat lobules；可為局灶性，壞死 septa 與 lobules 旁緊鄰大片正常脂肪。<span class="ex-ref">p.1268–1269</span></li>
<li>Liquefactive necrosis 與 dermal collagen 溶解可伴潰瘍；elastic tissue 退化可致 septal 破壞，形成 "floating" necrotic fat lobules；late-stage 以 lymphocytes、foamy histiocytes 與不同程度纖維化取代。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
<li>McKee：特徵為 normal fat adjacent to necrotic and inflamed fat；special stains 常見 elastic tissue 斷裂與消失；可見出血與血管 thrombosis，但 no evidence of active vasculitis；heavy neutrophil infiltrate 可與感染混淆，必要時做 microorganisms 特殊染色。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358–359</span></li>
<li>有時 histopathology 缺乏特徵；有潰瘍病灶但病理不典型時，要考慮做 serum protein levels 與 phenotype testing；因這些蛋白的複雜性，建議同時取得 serum protein levels 與 phenotyping。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-8）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Infection-induced panniculitis；factitial panniculitis（geometric morphology、常有 psychiatric disturbance、找到 foreign material 有幫助）；erythema induratum/nodular vasculitis；pancreatic panniculitis；subcutaneous Sweet syndrome；pyoderma gangrenosum（violaceous, undermined borders with isomorphic response）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
<li>Neutrophilic panniculitis 也可見於 IIP、factitial 或 traumatic panniculitis、pancreatic panniculitis、藥物相關（vemurafenib、ponatinib）、subcutaneous Sweet syndrome、myelodysplasia 相關、cutaneous Crohn disease、familial Mediterranean fever、rheumatoid arthritis 與 idiopathic neutrophilic panniculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>皮膚與皮下壞死可快速發展；曾有致死病例，主要是 ZZ variant；及時診斷並以 α1AT augmentation 治療重症，可能顯著改善 panniculitis 並誘發臨床緩解；但 α1AT deficiency 的肺與肝疾病優先順序高得多，與 pulmonologists 及 hepatologists 共同照護是理想作法。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
<li>用過的治療：colchicine、antimalarials、dapsone、doxycycline、plasma infusion 與 plasma exchange、intravenous augmentation therapy、liver transplantation；<strong>Steroids, immunosuppressives, and cytotoxic agents are less effective</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
<li>Doxycycline 尤其 dapsone 可用於 mild to moderate disease，特別是 heterozygous（如 MZ）；severe panniculitis 對標準治療無效時需 protein-replacement therapy（augmentation）：建議 α1AT infusions <strong class="ex-n">60 mg/kg</strong>，常先給數次每週輸注，復發時重複。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
<li>肝移植後 panniculitis 可緩解；此病傷口癒合不良，延遲 augmentation 可能造成嚴重併發症；因 trauma 可在 one-third 病人誘發病灶，debridement is discouraged。<span class="ex-ref">p.1269</span></li>
<li>Table 73-1：mild-moderate 用 dapsone、doxycycline；severe 用 protein replacement therapy。<span class="ex-ref">p.1253</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick 寫 panniculitis uncommonly occurs in α1AT deficiency（p.1267），ZZ 是最常引起 panniculitis 的 phenotype（p.1268）。Debridement 在此病是 discouraged（p.1269）。Fitzpatrick 的 α1AT panniculitis 臨床特徵段落沒有提到 fever（p.1267）；McKee 寫 fever 是 common accompaniment（McKee p.358）。</aside>
<h3>兩本書不一致處</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Fitzpatrick 9e</th><th scope="col">McKee 5e</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Sex</td><td><strong class="ex-n">65%</strong> 為女性<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></td><td>Slight male predominance（<strong class="ex-n">3 : 2</strong>）<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Age</td><td>Most often between ages <strong class="ex-n">30 and 60</strong> years<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></td><td>多數在 fourth or fifth decade（範圍 7–73 歲）<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Inheritance</td><td>Codominant<span class="ex-ref">p.1267</span></td><td>Inherited as an autosomal dominant<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="pancreatic">
<h2>7. Pancreatic Panniculitis（胰臟性脂肪層炎）</h2>
<ul>
<li>發生率：<strong class="ex-n">0.3% to 3%</strong> 的胰臟疾病病人（acute 或 chronic pancreatitis、pancreatic carcinoma、pancreatic pseudocysts）；Table 73-1 寫 2%-3%；McKee 寫 <strong class="ex-n">1–3%</strong>。胰臟任何疾病都可能相關；ERCP 之後也可發生。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1253</span><span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.365</span></li>
<li>Panniculitis 可在確診胰臟疾病前數週到數月出現，在 up to <strong class="ex-n">45%</strong> 的病人；病人可能沒有腹部症狀，所以任何 panniculitis 都要考慮 pancreatic panniculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1272</span> McKee：panniculitis 可為 presenting sign，高達 <strong class="ex-n">35%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.365</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li>病灶呈 crops，出現在 lower legs（尤其 periarticular areas），也可在手臂、手腕、大腿與軀幹；ill-defined erythematous 到 red-brown 的 edematous tender nodules，可消退成 atrophic hyperpigmented scars；可 fluctuant、似膿瘍，並流出 oily material，與 α1AT panniculitis 的病灶相似。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span></li>
<li>Extracutaneous：periarticular fat necrosis 合併 arthritis、骨髓 fat necrosis 疼痛；monoarticular 或 oligoarticular arthritis 在超過一半的病人出現；pancreatic disease + panniculitis + polyarthritis 稱 <strong>PPP syndrome</strong>，very rare，與 pancreatitis 和 pancreatic carcinoma 都有關。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span></li>
<li>Pleural effusions 與 serositis 也可見，pleural effusions 與高死亡率相關；eosinophilia 可見於 pancreatitis 或 pancreatic malignancy；<strong>Schmid triad</strong>：pancreatic tumor（或 pancreatitis）+ panniculitis + polyarthritis + eosinophilia，預後差；secondary infection 是重要併發症。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：病灶常 spontaneously ulcerate；最常在 lower extremities（ankles 與 knees 周圍）；胰臟炎相關病灶隨胰臟改善而消退，胰臟癌相關者傾向持續，可能致命。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Pathogenesis &amp; Histopathology（機轉與病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>一般歸因於 pancreatic enzymes（lipase、amylase、trypsin）釋入循環，增加血管通透性與損傷，使 adipocytes 釋出 fatty acids 造成 fat necrosis；但也有血清胰臟酵素正常的病例報告。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270–1271</span></li>
<li>Lobular fat necrosis：adipocytes 失去細胞核但保留周邊輪廓，形成 <strong>"ghost cells"</strong>；<strong>saponification</strong> 造成 calcification，產生細顆粒的 basophilic deposits；ghost cells 常聚集在 fat lobules 中央，周邊有 neutrophils 浸潤。<span class="ex-ref">p.1271</span></li>
<li>舊病灶中，壞死與 ghost cells 被 foamy histiocytes、multinucleated giant cells、lymphocytes 取代，最終纖維化。<span class="ex-ref">p.1271</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：mostly lobular panniculitis without vasculitis；adipocytes 中央 intense necrosis；ghost cell adipocytes 含 finely granular basophilic intracytoplasmic material。<span class="ex-ref">p.1270</span></li>
<li>McKee：ghost cells 為 anucleate、由 amorphous granular debris 組成，常有 eosinophilia 的邊緣；calcification 造成 stippled basophilia；hemorrhage 幾乎必有；可見 Splendore-Hoeppli reaction；birefringent crystals 見於 mesenteric fat 與受累關節，但不見於 subcutaneous fat。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.366–367</span></li>
<li>鑑別：mucormycosis 與 aspergillosis 可造成 "ghost cell" adipocytes，尤其在 immunocompromised 病人，須做 fungal 檢查排除；deep fungal infections 與 interferon beta 注射也可模仿 pancreatic fat necrosis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1266</span><span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.367</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>胰臟病變緩解後皮膚症狀隨之改善；mortality 為 <strong class="ex-n">24%</strong> 至 <strong class="ex-n">42%</strong>，pancreatic carcinoma 病人 mortality 接近 <strong class="ex-n">100%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1272</span></li>
<li>治療重點在 underlying pancreatic disease，常為支持性；<strong>octreotide</strong>（somatostatin analog）與 <strong>plasmapheresis</strong> 與 pancreatic panniculitis 的緩解有關；胰臟癌可用 surgical resection 與 combination chemotherapy 改善皮膚表現。<span class="ex-ref">p.1272</span></li>
<li>Table 73-4 與 73-5 對 pancreatic panniculitis 的描述：occurs anywhere on the legs，ulceration and drainage；serum lipase and amylase often elevated。<span class="ex-ref">p.1258</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1261</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-9）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristic features</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>α1-Antitrypsin deficiency</td><td>Tender, erythematous nodules, often with a suppurative exudate；located on the abdomen, buttocks, and proximal extremities</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema induratum / nodular vasculitis</td><td>Tender nodules and plaques on calf areas；living in an area endemic for tuberculosis（erythema induratum）；vasculitis present on histopathology</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutaneous polyarteritis nodosa</td><td>Nodules in association with livedo reticularis and arterial inflammation on histology，possibly with neuropathy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Infection-induced panniculitis</td><td>Erythema nodosum-like nodules, deep inflamed nodules or abscesses；older lesions may show fibrosis；most commonly on legs；often seen in severely immunosuppressed patients；mucormycosis 與 aspergillosis 相關的 pancreatitis 可見 "ghost cell" changes 與 urate crystals（secondary to fungal enzymatic changes）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pyoderma gangrenosum</td><td>Violaceous, undermined borders with isomorphic response</td></tr>
<tr><td>Malignancies</td><td>Persistent, worsening disease，often with systemic symptoms；cutaneous T-cell lymphoma、angiosarcoma 或其他 sarcomas on leg；more likely in patients with solid-organ transplants or other immunosuppressed states</td></tr>
<tr><td>Behçet syndrome occurring in the fat</td><td>Vasculitis in fat tissue（lymphocytic or neutrophilic）；small arterial involvement；lobular 或 mixed lobular and septal pattern</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-9，p.1272。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="lep">
<h2>8. Lupus Erythematosus Panniculitis, LEP（紅斑性狼瘡脂肪層炎）</h2>
<h3>Definition &amp; Epidemiology（定義與流行病學）</h3>
<ul>
<li>別名：lupus profundus、subcutaneous lupus erythematosus、Irrgang-Kaposi syndrome；Kaposi 於 1883 年首次描述，Irrgang 於 1940 年命名為 lupus erythematous profundus；即使在 lupus erythematosus 族群也 very rare。<span class="ex-ref">p.1272</span></li>
<li>LEP 可為 lupus 的唯一表現，也可發生在 discoid lupus erythematosus（DLE）或 SLE 發病之前或之後。LEP 病人中 SLE 的比率為 <strong class="ex-n">10% to 41%</strong>，DLE 為 <strong class="ex-n">21% to 60%</strong>；SLE 病人中只有 <strong class="ex-n">2% to 5%</strong> 會有 LEP。<span class="ex-ref">p.1272</span></li>
<li>女性較多，female-to-male ratio 約 <strong class="ex-n">4:1</strong>；most common between ages <strong class="ex-n">30 and 60</strong>，罕見於兒童甚至 neonatal lupus；與 SLE 並存時 LEP 傾向發生在較輕的 SLE；Raynaud phenomenon 見於 <strong class="ex-n">10%</strong>；可併 Sjögren syndrome 與 rheumatoid arthritis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1272–1273</span></li>
<li>McKee：SLE 病人中 lupus panniculitis 發生率 <strong class="ex-n">2% to 10%</strong>；DLE 見於 <strong class="ex-n">33% to 70%</strong>；Mayo Clinic 系列中 <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong> 沒有任何自體免疫疾病證據。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.383</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical features（臨床表現）</h3>
<ul>
<li>病灶可 tender 且疼痛，通常出現在 <strong>lateral upper arms、shoulders、face、scalp、hips、buttocks、breasts</strong>，rarely 在 lower extremities；為 deep subcutaneous nodules，表面可有或沒有變化（erythema 與 DLE 特徵，如 atrophy、hyperkeratosis、色素變化、telangiectasia、follicular plugging、focal necrosis）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1273</span></li>
<li>Ulceration 可見於 up to <strong class="ex-n">28%</strong>；進行性病灶可造成皮下萎縮與疤痕，臉部萎縮造成嚴重外觀改變；trauma（包括 injections 與 surgical procedures）可誘發病灶；Resolves with depressed lipoatrophic areas。<span class="ex-ref">p.1273</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1253</span></li>
<li>Serology 可正常或異常：合併 SLE 者 ANA titers 較高，可有 C4 deficiency；其他可見 rheumatoid factor、false-positive VDRL、leukopenia、anemia、thrombocytopenia；antiphospholipid antibodies 可能陽性。<span class="ex-ref">p.1273</span></li>
<li>Lupus mastitis 是侵犯乳房的罕見型，臨床上可模仿 Paget disease；mammography 見沿 fat necrosis 走向的 calcification。<span class="ex-ref">p.1273</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Histopathology（病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>約 <strong class="ex-n">20% to 30%</strong> 的 LEP 有 DLE 的組織學特徵：basal cell layer 的 vacuolization、thickened basement membrane、dermal collagen bundles 間的 mucin deposition、淺層與深層 perivascular lymphocytic infiltrate。<span class="ex-ref">p.1274</span></li>
<li>脂肪組織：lobular 或 mixed lobular and septal panniculitis，有 lymphocytes、<strong>lymphoid follicles</strong>（<strong class="ex-n">20%</strong> 有 germinal centers）、variable <strong>hyaline fat necrosis</strong>、hyalinized 與 sclerotic septal collagen bundles，並有 lymphocytes 與 plasma cells 的間質浸潤。可見 karyorrhexis、lymphocytic vasculitis 與 membranocystic changes。<span class="ex-ref">p.1274</span></li>
<li>Calcification 或 fibrin thrombi 見於 <strong class="ex-n">10%</strong>；eosinophils 見於 <strong class="ex-n">22% to 41%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1274</span></li>
<li><strong>DIF</strong>（血管與 basement membrane）：幾乎所有合併 SLE 的 LEP 呈陽性，沒有 SLE 的 LEP 也有高比例陽性。<span class="ex-ref">p.1274</span></li>
<li>IHC：以 lymphocytes 為主，αβ T-helper（CD4+）與 cytotoxic（CD8+）lymphocytes 混合 CD20+ B cells 與 plasma cells。<span class="ex-ref">p.1274</span></li>
<li>McKee：深部 dermis 與增寬的 septa 有以 nodules of lymphocytes 為主、plasma cells 較少的浸潤，常見 lymphocytic nuclear dust；deep dermis 與 septa 的 collagen 有 fibrinoid degenerative changes，進展期有 glassy eosinophilic necrosis 使皮下脂肪呈 hyalinized 外觀；可有 mucin deposition 與 calcification；predominant cells 為 α/β T-helper lymphocytes 並混有 B lymphocytes，PCR 通常為 polyclonal；immunofluorescence 常見 immunoglobulin 與 complement 沉積於 dermoepidermal junction。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.385–386</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>LEP vs SPTCL（皮下脂肪層炎樣 T 細胞淋巴瘤）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Favors LEP</th><th scope="col">Favors SPTCL</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Site</td><td>More often the face</td><td>More often the scalp, lower extremities, buttocks（Table 73-10）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cytology</td><td>—</td><td>Lymphocytic atypia and lymphocytic rimming</td></tr>
<tr><td>Adipocyte membrane / lipomembranous change</td><td>Lack of adipocyte membrane disruption suggests LEP；hyaline lipomembranous change is common in LEP</td><td>Hyaline lipomembranous change seen infrequently</td></tr>
<tr><td>MxA</td><td>High levels in the infiltrate</td><td>Minimal, less than 20% staining suggests a lymphoma</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ki-67</td><td>—</td><td>Staining greater than 20% 較提示 SPTCL</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD123</td><td>CD123-positive staining suggests LEP；percentage 較高者對 steroid 反應較好</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>CCL5</td><td>較低</td><td>Expression much higher in lymphomas</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.1274（內文）；Table 73-10，p.1274。McKee p.387 另寫：atypical lymphocytes with cytotoxic T-cell features（CD3+、CD8+）、高 proliferation rate 與 monoclonal TCR-γ rearrangement 提示 lymphoma；clusters of CD123 positive plasmacytoid dendritic cells 較提示 lupus panniculitis。</p>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>慢性發炎疾病，有 periodic flares 或長期緩解；平均病程 <strong class="ex-n">6 years</strong>（範圍 &lt;1 到 38 年）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1274</span></li>
<li>防曬；<strong>antimalarials 是 first-line</strong>（hydroxychloroquine，可能是唯一需要的藥物），單用無效時可合併 quinacrine；antimalarials 在 smokers 效果減弱。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
<li>Topical steroids（特別是 occlusion 下）可有效；systemic corticosteroids 在疾病活動且嚴重時有效，用短療程或在啟動 antimalarial 期間使用，長期使用因 LEP 的慢性本質而避免。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
<li><strong>Intralesional steroids 不建議</strong>，因為創傷可能誘發進一步活化，也會造成萎縮。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
<li>其他：dapsone、thalidomide、cyclosporine、methotrexate、azathioprine、IVIG、tacrolimus；嚴重難治者可能需要 rituximab 或 infliximab（infliximab 須謹慎，因與某些情況下 lupus erythematosus 活化有關）；LEP 常有 calcification，diltiazem 等 calcium-channel blockers 是有效輔助。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>LEP 的好發部位是 lateral upper arms、shoulders、face、scalp、hips、buttocks、breasts，rarely 在 lower extremities（p.1273）；Table 73-1 寫 hydroxychloroquine is first-line treatment（p.1253）；intralesional steroids 不建議（p.1275）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="chp">
<h2>9. Cytophagic Histiocytic Panniculitis, CHP（噬血球性組織球性脂肪層炎）</h2>
<ul>
<li>罕見，病程從 3 個月到 27 年不等，可能致命；與 hemophagocytic lymphohistiocytosis（HLH）或 macrophage activation syndrome 相關時可為 aggressive disease 而需要化療；HLH 可為 primary（genetic）或 secondary（infections、autoimmune disease），但 CHP 的病因 only secondary。CHP 本身可能代表 "smoldering" lymphoma。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
<li>成人、青少年與兒童都可發生；最年長病例為 80 歲。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Clinical &amp; Laboratory（臨床與檢驗）</h3>
<ul>
<li>皮下 plaques 與 nodules（可融合），位於 extremities 與 trunk，較少在 head and neck；mucosal involvement rare；單一病灶可達 <strong class="ex-n">20 cm</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
<li>Fulminant form：fever、hepatosplenomegaly、lymphadenopathy、serosal effusions、pancytopenia、intravascular coagulation、liver failure、hemorrhagic diatheses 與死亡。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275–1276</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：fever、hepatosplenomegaly、<strong class="ex-n">2 or more</strong> cytopenias；hemocytophagocytosis in bone marrow、lymph nodes、liver 或 CNS；hypertriglyceridemia、ferritin &gt; <strong class="ex-n">500 mg/L</strong>；soluble CD25、CD163 增加；NK cell activity 與 fibrinogen 低或缺乏。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span></li>
<li>檢驗：CBC with differential、liver function、ferritin、ESR、lipid profile；<strong>ESR is often normal or low</strong>；soluble CD163 與 hemophagocytic disease activity 及 ferritin 相關，CHP 的濃度遠高於 sepsis 與正常對照；ANA 可能陽性，單靠它不能證明 LEP。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
<li>Hypertriglyceridemia 來自 lipoprotein lipase 受抑制（macrophages 分泌 IL-6、IL-1、TNF）；過高的血脂可造成 pancreatitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Pathogenesis &amp; Histopathology（機轉與病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>CHP 可能屬於會發展 reactive HLH/macrophage activation syndrome 的 benign lymphocytic infiltrate panniculitides 之一；secondary HLH 與 infections、connective tissue diseases、malignancies 或藥物相關；HLH 被視為 autoinflammatory disease，cytolytic T-cell 與 NK cell 功能受損。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
<li>LEP 與 CHP 在某些病例都可落在 subcutaneous lymphoid dyscrasia 的 spectrum（benign reactive changes 到 SPTCL）；SPTCL 的 αβ 或 γδ 型都可合併 HLH 並以 CHP 表現，γδ 型 HLH 發生率遠高於 αβ 型。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
<li>Principally <strong>lobular panniculitis</strong>：fat lobules 含 histiocytes 與 mature lymphocytes（可有 plasma cells、neutrophils、eosinophils）；<strong>"beanbag cell"</strong> = phagocytic histiocytes 內含 intact 或 fragmented cells 與 nuclear debris。需多次 biopsy，因 cytophagocytosis 可為局灶性。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
<li>不同於 emperipolesis（intact cell 穿過 histiocyte 的細胞質而無 nuclear debris）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
<li>IHC：cytophagic histiocytes 表現 CD68，多數 lymphocytes 為 T-cell immunophenotype；atypical lymphocytes、lymphocytic rimming of adipocytes 與 clonality 令人擔心 lymphoma。<span class="ex-ref">p.1276</span></li>
<li>McKee：histiocytes 有豐富 eosinophilic cytoplasm；erythrophagocytosis invariably 存在；giant cells 與 granulomata 通常不是特徵（除非合併 fat necrosis）；須與 subcutaneous panniculitic T-cell lymphoma（淋巴球有 cytologic atypia、karyorrhexis 與 mitotic activity）、angiocentric lymphoma、cutaneous Rosai-Dorfman disease（histiocytes S100 陽性）區分。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.364</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>可有 rapidly fatal 的病程、持續多年的間歇緩解與惡化，或 nonfatal acute/intermittent 病程。及時使用 corticosteroids 與 cyclosporine 可能使 <strong class="ex-n">70%</strong> mortality 降到接近 0%；皮膚病灶緩解不一定代表疾病嚴重度改善，須持續追蹤全身侵犯。<span class="ex-ref">p.1277</span></li>
<li>需 multidisciplinary care，可能須住院。HLH 合併感染時，治療病原可能康復但不可預測。<span class="ex-ref">p.1277–1278</span></li>
<li>治療：<strong>cyclosporine 與 corticosteroids</strong> 常用且常成功；tacrolimus（cyclosporine 抗藥或不耐受時）、azathioprine、anakinra、cyclophosphamide 加 IVIG；etoposide、high-dose IVIG、antithymocyte globulin 也被提到；CHP 合併 HLH/macrophage activation syndrome 需 combined chemotherapy 與 aggressive supportive care；與 SPTCL 相關時須更積極治療。<span class="ex-ref">p.1275</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1278</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-11）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristic features</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>α1-Antitrypsin deficiency</td><td>Tender, erythematous nodules that often have a suppurative exudate；located on the lower abdomen, buttocks, and proximal extremities；serology for enzymatic levels and phenotype helpful</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema induratum / nodular vasculitis</td><td>Tender nodules and plaques on calf areas；living in an area endemic for tuberculosis（erythema induratum）；vasculitis present on histopathology</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutaneous polyarteritis nodosa</td><td>Nodules in association with livedo reticularis and arterial inflammation on histology，possibly with neuropathy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Infection-induced panniculitis</td><td>Erythema nodosum-like nodules, deep and inflamed nodules, or abscesses；older lesions may show fibrosis；most commonly on legs；systemic symptoms possible with fever；often seen in severely immunosuppressed patients with malignancies</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pyoderma gangrenosum</td><td>Violaceous, undermined borders with isomorphic response；rare to mild systemic symptoms</td></tr>
<tr><td>Malignancies</td><td>Persistent, worsening disease, often with systemic symptoms；subcutaneous panniculitis-like T-cell lymphoma must be distinguished from atypical lymphocytic panniculitis；cutaneous T-cell lymphoma、angiosarcoma 或其他 sarcomas on leg；more likely, but not exclusively, in patients with solid-organ transplants or other immunosuppressed states</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-11，p.1277。</p>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick 寫 CHP is only secondary in etiology（p.1275）；ESR is often normal or low（p.1276）；Table 73-1 的 CHP 治療為 corticosteroids、cyclosporine、multidisciplinary care in a hospital setting（p.1253）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="scfn">
<h2>10. Subcutaneous Fat Necrosis of the Newborn, SCFN（新生兒皮下脂肪壞死）</h2>
<h3>Epidemiology &amp; Clinical features（流行病學與臨床）</h3>
<ul>
<li>SCFN 是罕見 panniculitis，發生在出生後 first few days to weeks；幾乎所有病例會自行緩解；<strong>最常見的併發症是 hypercalcemia</strong>，另有 hypertriglyceridemia、hypoglycemia、thrombocytopenia、anemia。<span class="ex-ref">p.1278</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="115-18">多見於 full-term 或 postterm 新生兒（preterm 也有報告），之前有 perinatal complications：meconium aspiration、asphyxia、hypothermia（如心臟手術或 hypoxic ischemic encephalopathy 的治療性低溫）、hypoxemia、seizures、sepsis、gestational diabetes、preeclampsia、需 cesarean section 的因素、forceps delivery、severe neonatal anemia、maternal cocaine use、failure to thrive</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1278</span></li>
<li>病灶：sharply demarcated、erythematous 到 violaceous、firm、indurated 的 nodules 或 plaques，位於 back、shoulders、arms、buttocks、thighs 或 face，但 rarely 在 anterior trunk 或 anterolateral shins；大小數 mm 至 up to <strong class="ex-n">11 cm</strong>；可為單發或多發；少見 fluctuant nodules 流出 oily 或 chalky white material；lesions are not warm to touch，通常無痛。<span class="ex-ref">p.1278</span></li>
<li>Metabolic complications：hypercalcemia 影響 <strong class="ex-n">36% to 56%</strong> 的病人（McKee 寫 29% 到 69%）；thrombocytopenia、hypertriglyceridemia、hypoglycemia、anemia；hypercalcemia 可無症狀，或表現為 failure to thrive、irritability、fever、vomiting、hypotonia、seizures、polyuria 與 polydipsia，甚至死亡。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279</span><span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.367</span></li>
<li>At-a-glance：hypercalcemia 在某些病例甚至出現在急性期之後。<span class="ex-ref">p.1278</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Pathogenesis（機轉）</h3>
<ul>
<li>病因不明，hypothermia 與 hypoxia 被推測與此有關；可能為 neonatal fat 組成或代謝的 biochemical defect，在 cold stress 後結晶並發炎。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279</span></li>
<li>Hypercalcemia 可能與肉芽腫浸潤內 25-hydroxyvitamin D3–1α hydroxylase 增加有關。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279</span></li>
<li>新生兒 brown adipose tissue（BAT）在 cold stress 下快速將脂肪轉成熱；SCFN 受累的 BAT 已用 uncoupling protein isoform 1 免疫染色證實。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279</span></li>
<li>McKee：neonatal fat 的 saturated fatty acids 含量高、melting point 高，易在 neonatal hypothermia 下沉澱。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.368</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Histopathology（病理）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Mostly lobular panniculitis：fat lobule 局灶壞死，浸潤含 lymphocytes、histiocytes、foreign-body giant cells，可有少量 eosinophils；<strong>no vasculitis</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279</span></li>
<li>許多 adipocytes 保留輪廓，但含細 eosinophilic strands 與 granules，及呈 <strong>radial array 的 needle-shaped clefts</strong>；frozen section 中 clefts 內為 doubly refractile crystals，代表 triglycerides；multinucleated giant cells 的細胞質內也可見；late-stage 有 fibrosis 與 calcified areas。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279–1280</span></li>
<li>主要為 neutrophilic infiltrate 時（尤其在病灶 1 天大時 biopsy）可能模仿感染；fine-needle aspiration 與 ultrasonography 可輔助診斷。<span class="ex-ref">p.1279–1280</span></li>
<li>McKee：individual adipocytes 腫脹，含 abundant radially arranged eosinophilic crystalline spaces；crystals 主要為 triglycerides；neutrophils 通常缺乏或只佔少數；poststeroid panniculitis 有相同組織學。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.368–369</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Differential diagnosis（Table 73-12）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis</th><th scope="col">Characteristics</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Cellulitis</td><td>Larger plaques，erythematous，usually lacking the violaceous bruising；tender and warm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cold panniculitis</td><td>Exposure to cold in both children and adults，not specific to the setting of hypoxia；histopathology lacks needle-shaped clefts；resolves with rewarming</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sclerema neonatorum</td><td>Diffuse skin hardening，particularly on buttocks and thighs，stressed infants in the first week of life（often low weight and premature）；histopathology also shows needle-shaped clefts, with minimal inflammation；poor prognosis with systemic illness</td></tr>
<tr><td>Poststeroid panniculitis</td><td>Occurs in children，usually 10 days after rapid cessation of high-dose systemic corticosteroid therapy；similar histopathology to SCFN</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-12，p.1280（以原頁圖片核對）。</p>
<h3>Course &amp; Management（病程與治療）</h3>
<ul>
<li>SCFN 為 benign process，prognosis 極佳；病灶在數週至 6 個月內消退，部分留下萎縮；hypercalcemia 是最嚴重的潛在不良結果，可造成 nephrocalcinosis，甚至嚴重 hypercalcemia 也可無症狀。<span class="ex-ref">p.1280</span></li>
<li><strong>Hypercalcemia 的發生可延遲到皮膚病灶出現後 6 個月</strong>，所以須 serial monitoring serum calcium。<span class="ex-ref">p.1280</span></li>
<li>治療以保守為主；為避免破裂、感染、壞死與疤痕可抽吸病灶。Hypercalcemia 時：hydration、calcium-wasting diuretic furosemide、low calcium formula；systemic glucocorticoids 可抑制發炎 AT 內 macrophages 的 vitamin D 生成；bisphosphonates（alendronate、etidronate、pamidronate）可治療 hypercalcemia。Renal ultrasound 可偵測 nephrocalcinosis；nephrocalcinosis 可在皮膚反應良好時仍發生。<span class="ex-ref">p.1280</span></li>
<li>預防：冷卻（cooling）時每 3 小時翻動新生兒與使用較溫和的 cooling device 的 nursing protocol 可降低風險。<span class="ex-ref">p.1280</span></li>
<li>McKee：sclerema neonatorum 的組織學 no necrosis or significant inflammatory cell infiltrate，mortality <strong class="ex-n">75–90%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.369</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Table 73-1 寫 SCFN 的 anterior trunk spared（p.1254）；SCFN 的 hypercalcemia 可延遲到皮膚病灶出現後 6 個月才出現（p.1280），Table 73-1 寫 monitor for 6 months（p.1254）；Table 73-1 的治療欄為 spontaneous resolution、monitor serum calcium（p.1254）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="cold">
<h2>11. Cold Panniculitis（冷脂肪層炎）</h2>
<ul>
<li>又稱 <strong>Haxthausen disease</strong>，1902 年首次描述；發生在 equestrians 時稱 horse rider's pernio 或 equestrian panniculitis；也可發生於黏膜（popsicle panniculitis）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1281</span></li>
<li>多見於兒童與年輕女性騎馬者及有適當暴露的成人；scrotal cold panniculitis 見於 <strong class="ex-n">9- to 14-year-old</strong> overweight 男孩，在 cold exposure（包括冷海水游泳）之後；Finland 的調查顯示 <strong class="ex-n">25%</strong> 騎馬者在冬季有症狀；風險因子包括 moderate smoking、全天穿緊身騎馬服、長時間騎乘、&lt;<strong class="ex-n">35</strong> 歲。<span class="ex-ref">p.1281</span></li>
<li>臨床：在冷暴露部位出現 indurated、erythematous plaques 或 nodules；起病在暴露後 <strong class="ex-n">6 to 72 hours</strong>；equestrians 在 lateral thighs；scrotal 型為睪丸下方的 tender masses，數日到數週自發緩解；equestrian 病灶 pruritic，可局部潰瘍、結痂、流液。<span class="ex-ref">p.1281</span></li>
<li>Pathogenesis：嬰兒 saturated fat 對 unsaturated fat 的比例較高，隨年齡變得較不飽和；BAT 也可能參與；equestrian panniculitis 可能代表 perniosis/chilblains 而非真正的 panniculitis；cryoglobulins 與 cold agglutinins 被認為不扮演角色。<span class="ex-ref">p.1281</span></li>
<li>Histopathology：mostly lobular panniculitis，lymphohistiocytic 或 mixed infiltrate；淺層與深層 perivascular 與 periadnexal lymphocytic infiltrate，dermal–subcutaneous junction 的靜脈發炎明顯，與 perniosis 很像；no vasculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1280</span><span class="ex-ref">p.1281</span></li>
<li>McKee：浸潤在 dermis 與皮下脂肪交界最明顯，含 lymphocytes、histiocytes 與 neutrophils；frank vasculitis 不是特徵；cold panniculitis 與 ice-pack dermatosis 可酷似 lupus profundus 的 pattern。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.362</span><span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.387</span></li>
<li>病程：self-limiting，rewarming 後緩解，數日到 <strong class="ex-n">3 months</strong> 內完全改善；可能殘留 postinflammatory hyperpigmentation。治療只需避免再暴露於冷；equestrians 可穿保暖衣物與局部 corticosteroid，並戒菸；<strong>Nifedipine is not an effective treatment</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1281–1282</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Diagnosis（Table 73-13）</th><th scope="col">Characteristic features</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Cellulitis</td><td>Large plaques，often unilateral, erythematous, tender and warm；systemic findings 可有 fever 與 leukocytosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>SCFN</td><td>Cold exposure in infants in the setting of hypoxia；needle-shaped clefts；hypercalcemia possible</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sclerema neonatorum</td><td>Diffuse skin hardening；needle-shaped clefts with minimal inflammation；poor prognosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Poststeroid panniculitis</td><td>Children，usually within 10 days after rapid cessation of high-dose systemic corticosteroid therapy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema nodosum</td><td>Violaceous or red plaques on the anterior legs with no ulceration</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 73-13，p.1282。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="factitial">
<h2>12. Factitial &amp; Traumatic Panniculitis（人為與創傷性脂肪層炎）</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Factitial panniculitis</strong>（Munchausen syndrome 的變異型）：自我造成的機械、物理或化學創傷引起皮下發炎；<strong>traumatic panniculitis</strong>：傷害不是病人自己造成，例如 postsurgical panniculitis 或運動傷後。<span class="ex-ref">p.1282</span></li>
<li>臨床：erythematous、geometric 的 papules 與 nodules，伴 erosions 或 ulcerations（部位或外觀不一致）；常見於有 personality aberrations 的病人，皮下植入物可為 medications、cosmetic fillers、oils、food 或 human waste；traumatic panniculitis 可由 cupping、acupuncture、electropuncture 或 immunizations/therapeutic injections 造成；secondary hypertrichosis 罕見。<span class="ex-ref">p.1282</span></li>
<li>Histopathology：mostly nonspecific lobular panniculitis without vasculitis，隨原因而異；suppurative granuloma involving the fat lobule，須做 cultures；偏光顯微鏡可找到 macrophages 內 refractile foreign material；晚期有 foamy histiocytes、纖維化與 dystrophic calcific deposits。<span class="ex-ref">p.1282</span></li>
<li>治療：self-inflicted 者用 psychiatric treatment；介入阻止注射可疑物質並支持性照護；植入物常須手術切除；traumatic panniculitis 沒有持續創傷時為 self-limiting。<span class="ex-ref">p.1282</span></li>
<li>McKee：subcutaneous injection of chemical substances 是 factitial panniculitis 最常見的病因；paraffinoma 呈 "Swiss cheese" pattern（皮膚與皮下脂肪內圓形或卵圓形空洞，邊緣有 foamy histiocytes 或 giant cells）；povidone panniculitis 為 histiocytes 內 gray-blue、Congo red-positive foamy material；blunt trauma 的病灶像 organizing hematoma。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.359–360</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="other-ctd">
<h2>13. Connective Tissue Disease-Associated, Gouty &amp; Poststeroid Panniculitis（結締組織病相關、痛風性與類固醇後脂肪層炎）</h2>
<h3>Connective tissue disease-associated panniculitis</h3>
<ul>
<li>最常與 <strong>dermatomyositis</strong> 相關，可在疾病之前、同時或晚期出現，嚴重度與疾病 flares 相關；erythematous、tender 到 painful 的 nodules 與 plaques，位於 arms、buttocks、thighs、abdomen；併發症有 ulceration 與 lipoatrophy。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>Panniculitis 偶爾是 dermatomyositis 的首發表現；兒童的 panniculitis 應促成 connective tissue disease 的檢查；可同時有感染，免疫抑制前須先治療；與 morphea 和 systemic sclerosis 的關聯罕見；須把 SPTCL 列入鑑別。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>Histopathology：mostly lobular panniculitis，lymphocytic 與 plasma cell 浸潤，伴 dermal mucin 與 vacuolar interface change（類似 lupus panniculitis）；可有 calcification；late-stage 的 membranocystic change 提示較差預後。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>治療同 dermatomyositis：corticosteroids、immunosuppressants（azathioprine、mycophenolate mofetil、methotrexate）與 IVIG；病灶內 calcification 可能受益於 IVIG；<strong>antimalarials 對 dermatomyositis-associated panniculitis 無效</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>McKee：dermatomyositis panniculitis 的組織學為以 lobular 為主的 lymphocytes 與 plasma cells 浸潤，可有帶 germinal centers 的 lymphoid follicles，septa 逐漸增厚、hyalinized；calcification 為晚期變化；大多數病例 immunofluorescence 為陰性。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.387</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Gouty panniculitis</h3>
<ul>
<li>Subcutaneous urate crystals 是 gout 的罕見表現；最常見為 firm、indurated 的 nodules 或 plaques，lower extremities，壓痛程度不一；潰瘍處可覆蓋 chalky substance；可有 hyperuricemia 與 arthralgias；病灶可先於 gout 診斷，但常是 chronic gout 的晚期後果。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>Histopathology：AT 內細小、放射狀排列的 <strong>needle-shaped urate crystals</strong>，周圍 granulomatous inflammation；monosodium urate crystals 具 refractile 且 <strong>negatively birefringent</strong>；alcohol fixation 有助於結晶可視化；no evidence of vasculitis。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>治療：allopurinol（high doses）、probenecid、colchicine 等消炎藥；急性 panniculitis 可用 corticosteroids；不癒合的潰瘍病灶可能需手術。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>McKee：direct detection of crystals with polarized light 需要 ethanol fixation 或 touch imprint slides。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.372</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Poststeroid panniculitis</h3>
<ul>
<li>罕見，多見於兒童在 high doses of systemic corticosteroid 之後，abrupt withdrawal 後數日到數週；成人病例 very rare；erythematous、tender 的 nodules 與 plaques，位於 cheeks、trunk、arms 與 legs。<span class="ex-ref">p.1283</span></li>
<li>數週到數月內緩解且不留疤，可殘留 hyperpigmentation；最常見併發症是 ulceration；全身症狀罕見。<span class="ex-ref">p.1284</span></li>
<li>Histopathology：lobular panniculitis with lymphocytic 與 granulomatous infiltrate，no vasculitis；有 radial 排列的 needle-shaped clefts，類似 SCFN 與 sclerema neonatorum（sclerema neonatorum 缺乏或僅少量發炎）；multinucleated giant cells 可含 needle-shaped clefts 與 foamy histiocytes。<span class="ex-ref">p.1284</span></li>
<li>即使不治療也會在數週到數月內緩解；有人推測逐漸減量 steroids 可消除風險。<span class="ex-ref">p.1284</span></li>
<li>McKee：poststeroid panniculitis 的組織學與 SCFN 相同；曾發生在以非常大劑量 steroid 治療風濕熱或腎絲球腎炎的兒童，突然停藥後在 cheeks、arms、trunk 出現 subcutaneous swellings；因標準做法為 steroid taper，現已少見。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.369</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="mckee-others">
<h2>14. McKee 補充：其他 panniculitis 的病理重點</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Entity</th><th scope="col">McKee 病理與臨床重點</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Weber-Christian disease</td><td>原定義為 relapsing febrile nodular nonsuppurative panniculitis；McKee 認為它 unlikely represents a distinct entity，許多病例應重新分類（例如 EN、factitial、lupus、pancreatic、α1AT、感染、SPTCL 等）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.358</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Erythema nodosum-like lesions in Behçet disease</td><td>Behçet disease 病人中超過 <strong class="ex-n">40%</strong> 出現；較常見為 lobular 或 mixed septal and lobular panniculitis，伴 neutrophil-rich infiltrate、neutrophilic vasculitis 與 fat necrosis；Miescher granulomata 有時可見。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.357</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Subcutaneous sarcoidosis</td><td>以 lobule 為主的 well-formed noncaseating granulomata，常為 "naked" type（缺乏周邊淋巴球環）；為 diagnosis of exclusion。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.375</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Eosinophilic panniculitis</td><td>是 reaction pattern 而非獨立疾病；lobules 與 septa 有大量 eosinophils，可見 "flame figures"；vasculitis 通常不見。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.375</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Membranous fat necrosis</td><td>脂肪 lobules 內 amorphous、eosinophilic、PAS-positive 的膜狀構造圍繞 cysts；Sudan black 與 luxol fast blue 染色陽性；可見於 venous stasis（sclerosing panniculitis）、erythema nodosum、nodular vasculitis、lupus panniculitis 等多種疾病。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.378–379</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Scleroderma panniculitis（morphea profunda）</td><td>Deep dermis、皮下脂肪與肌肉 fascia 的結締組織增厚與 hyalinization；脂肪內 lymphocytic 與 plasma cell 浸潤。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.387</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>
